# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By measuring the control qubits, we obtain an eight-bit phase estimation of "
"the $M_a$ operator. We can convert this binary representation to decimal to "
"find the measured phase. As we can see from the above histogram, four "
"different bitstrings were measured, and each of them corresponds to a phase "
