msgid "Hardware runs {#hardware-runs}"
msgstr "Jalankan pada perkakasan {#hardware-runs}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we can run the order finding circuit that we previously transpiled for "
"`ibm_marrakesh`. Here we turn to [dynamical decoupling](/guides/error-"
"mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#dynamical-decoupling) (DD) for error "
"suppression, and [gate twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#pauli-twirling) for error mitigation purposes. DD involves "
"applying sequences of precisely timed control pulses to a quantum device, "
"effectively averaging out unwanted environmental interactions and "
"decoherence. Gate twirling, on the other hand, randomizes specific quantum "
"gates to transform coherent errors into Pauli errors, which accumulate "
"linearly rather than quadratically. Both techniques are often combined to "
"enhance the coherence and fidelity of quantum computations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita boleh menjalankan litar pencarian peringkat yang sebelum ini "
"kita transpil untuk `ibm_marrakesh`. Di sini kita beralih kepada [dynamical "
"decoupling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#dynamical-"
"decoupling) (DD) untuk penyekatan ralat, dan [gate twirling](/guides/error-"
"mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling) untuk tujuan "
"pengurangan ralat. DD melibatkan penerapan jujukan denyutan kawalan yang "
"tepat masanya pada peranti kuantum, yang secara efektif merata-rata "
"interaksi persekitaran yang tidak diingini dan penyahkoheranan. Gate "
"twirling pula merawakkan gate kuantum tertentu untuk mengubah ralat koheren "
"kepada ralat Pauli, yang terkumpul secara linear berbanding kuadratik. "
"Kedua-dua teknik ini sering digabungkan untuk meningkatkan koheranan dan "
"kesetiaan pengiraan kuantum.\n"

